---
// A text-only "about the brand" teaser for the homepage — no photography,
// no named founder. Generic, brand-voice copy about "our team" / "we",
// which links through to the full /about page.
---

<section id="about-teaser" class="about-teaser container">
	<div class="about-teaser-inner">
		<p class="eyebrow">About LUMÉ</p>
		<p class="about-teaser-quote">
			"We test everything we sell — the label matters far less to us than whether a product
			actually does what it promises."
		</p>
		<p class="about-teaser-body">
			LUMÉ started as a small, opinionated edit of skincare and beauty we'd genuinely recommend
			to a friend. Every brand on the shelf is chosen by our team, not an algorithm — a
			collection built slowly, one product that earned its place at a time.
		</p>
		<a href="/about" class="about-teaser-link">
			<span>Read our story</span>
			<svg width="15" height="10" viewBox="0 0 15 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2">
				<path d="M0 5h13M9 1l4 4-4 4" />
			</svg>
		</a>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about-teaser {
		padding-block: clamp(60px, 9vw, 120px);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
	}

	.about-teaser-inner {
		max-width: 680px;
		margin-inline: auto;
		text-align: center;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 20px;
	}

	.about-teaser-quote {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px);
		line-height: 1.4;
		margin: 4px 0 0;
	}

	.about-teaser-body {
		color: var(--color-ink-soft);
		line-height: 1.75;
		max-width: 56ch;
	}

	.about-teaser-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		font-size: 12px;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
		padding-bottom: 4px;
		margin-top: 4px;
	}

	.about-teaser-link svg {
		transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease);
	}

	.about-teaser-link:hover svg {
		transform: translateX(3px);
	}
</style>
